    {"type":"text","id":"tbl_t","x":100,"y":496,"width":1360,"height":260,"text":"# Comparison — retry-api-client\n\n| Criterion        | v1                          | v2                          | v3                           |\n|------------------|-----------------------------|-----------------------------|------------------------------|\n| Approach         | exponential backoff in HTTP | retry middleware            | per-route policy + budget    |\n| Files changed    | 6                           | 8                           | 14                           |\n| Lines +/−        | +180 / −12                  | +210 / −34                  | +420 / −90                   |\n| Tests            | 18/18 passed                | 24/24 passed                | 31/33 (2 flaky)              |\n| Review verdict   | passed                      | passed_with_suggestions     | passed_with_suggestions      |\n| Risk             | low                         | low                         | medium (scope creep)         |\n| Note             | simplest                    | best balance                | most flexible, costliest     |\n\n## Recommendation:  v2 — best balance of correctness, scope, and maintainability.","originalText":"# Comparison — retry-api-client\n\n| Criterion        | v1                          | v2                          | v3                           |\n|------------------|-----------------------------|-----------------------------|------------------------------|\n| Approach         | exponential backoff in HTTP | retry middleware            | per-route policy + budget    |\n| Files changed    | 6                           | 8                           | 14                           |\n| Lines +/−        | +180 / −12                  | +210 / −34                  | +420 / −90                   |\n| Tests            | 18/18 passed                | 24/24 passed                | 31/33 (2 flaky)              |\n| Review verdict   | passed                      | passed_with_suggestions     | passed_with_suggestions      |\n| Risk             | low                         | low                         | medium (scope creep)         |\n| Note             | simplest                    | best balance                | most flexible, costliest     |\n\n## Recommendation:  v2 — best balance of correctness, scope, and maintainability.","fontSize":11,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#a5f3fc","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":204,"version":1,"versionNonce":205,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.4},

    {"type":"text","id":"rules_hdr","x":80,"y":790,"width":800,"height":26,"text":"Hard rules","originalText":"Hard rules","fontSize":18,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#f87171","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":210,"version":1,"versionNonce":211,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.25},
    {"type":"text","id":"rules","x":80,"y":820,"width":1400,"height":100,"text":"•  All variants share the same base branch — required for fair comparison.         •  parallel pick: no merge, no push, no branch deletion at pick time.\n•  All variants share the same profile unless config explicitly overrides.           •  Publishing the winner is an explicit subsequent step (parallel pr create).\n•  Losers preserved by default — removed only by parallel drop / clean --stale-days.","originalText":"•  All variants share the same base branch — required for fair comparison.         •  parallel pick: no merge, no push, no branch deletion at pick time.\n•  All variants share the same profile unless config explicitly overrides.           •  Publishing the winner is an explicit subsequent step (parallel pr create).\n•  Losers preserved by default — removed only by parallel drop / clean --stale-days.","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#cbd5e1","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":212,"version":1,"versionNonce":213,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.6}
  ],
